  "description": "ESH.FirebaseNotification is a library for sending push notifications using Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM). It allows easy integration with .NET projects for sending notifications to mobile devices via Firebase. This package includes functionality for sending notifications to individual devices using device tokens or topics, with full support for Firebase Admin SDK and customizable notification messages.",
